            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The consensus was that this was the best ham ever. I used bourbon, and only 1 cup of it, and omitted the mustard (only because I didn't have any). After carving it, we put it all in a crock pot and poured all the juices over it and people ate on it all evening. I will definitely make this again.",
