            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Bobbie Russie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "BEST. HAM. EVER.\nI made this for a friend's Christmas party. OMG! Everyone loved it! A few people told me it was the best ham they ever had. I bought a 12lb. Hy-Vee smoked, spiral-cut ham. I used Scoresby blended Scotch ($10 a bottle--don't waste the good stuff!) I cooked it for 3 hours following the label on the ham. Great glaze, not too sweet and the cinnamon is very subtle (I'm not a big fan). Tender with great flavor! Great recipe. I am now required to make this ham every year!",
            "datePublished": "2016-12-10T23:30:01.637Z"
